I have checked out of that discussion myself.  I'm not comfortable
with the suggestion that it belongs somewhere else, though.  I don't
think conversations begin with an understanding that they'll grow
large in size and small in participants--they evolve that way as we
have them. 

I understand conversations involving technical details, jargon, and
unexplored corners to be on-topic for this list.

